# Reap What You Sow (windurst 29): Mashuu-Ajuu's line of Windurst mission 2-2 (A Testing Time: 192, an Event) next to
# his script's roll (463 or nothing), as Tauwawa's line does in making_the_grade#mission. A level-10 WAR, 2-2 current by
# GM, Reap What You Sow available: the mission's 192 plays on most talks and the script's 463 on its turns; his default
# 429 never plays. The order recorded on Lua: 192, 463, 192, 192, 192, 463, 192, 463.
lists WindurstWaters/Mashuu-Ajuu/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=129.6,-5.75,167.5 job=WAR lvl=10
mission Windurst ATestingTime current
login
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # the mission's 192
finish
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # his script's roll: 463
finish
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # the mission's 192
finish-if-event option=0
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # the mission's 192
finish
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # the mission's 192
finish
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # his script's roll: 463
finish-if-event option=0
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # the mission's 192
finish
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # his script's roll: 463
finish
